---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  eyebrow="Refunds"
  description="The working framework for refund requests relating to Pilot Journey purchases."
>
  <h2>1. Final policy pending</h2>
  <p>
    The definitive refund period, eligibility rules and request process will be published before checkout opens.
    Review the policy presented at purchase before completing an order.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Purchase provider</h2>
  <p>
    Payments, taxes and refunds are processed through Lemon Squeezy as the merchant of record. Approved refunds are
    returned through the original payment method according to its processing times.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Before requesting a refund</h2>
  <p>
    For installation, activation or simulator connection problems, contact support with your setup details. The
    operations desk may be able to resolve the issue without interrupting the license.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Contact</h2>
  <p>Refund questions can be sent to support@thepilotjourney.com.</p>
</LegalLayout>
